            "uco-core:description": "AG investigators searched a Roodhouse residence in September 2024 with Roodhouse PD and the ISP South Central Illinois Drug Task Force. The defendant was arrested after admitting possession. The CyberTip and 45-victim figures in the release are Illinois ICAC program background, not facts of this matter. CAC SHACL allows one performer."
